<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA FIFTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA FIFTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the fifth test between England and Australia at</p>
<p>Trent Bridge on Sunday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 427 (M.Taylor 76, S.Waugh 75,</p>
<p>M.Elliott 69, M.Waugh 68; D.Headley 4-87)</p>
<p>England first innings 313 (A.Stewart 87, G.Thorpe 53;</p>
<p> G.McGrath 4-71, S.Warne 4-86)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 167-4)</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Hussain b B.Hollioake   45</p>
<p> M.Elliott c Crawley b Caddick	37</p>
<p> G.Blewett c Stewart b Caddick	60</p>
<p> M.Waugh lbw b Headley		   7</p>
<p> S.Waugh c A.Holliaoke b Caddick    14</p>
<p> R.Ponting c Stewart b A.Holliaoke  45</p>
<p> I.Healy c Stewart b A.Hollioake    63</p>
<p> S.Warne c Thorpe b Croft	     20</p>
<p> P.Reiffel c b Holliaoke b Croft    22</p>
<p> J.Gillespie c Thorpe b Headley	4</p>
<p> G.McGrath not out			 1</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-11 nb-6)		18</p>
<p> Total				     336</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-51 2-105 3-134 4-156 5-171 6-278 7-292</p>
<p>8-314 9-326</p>
<p>Bowling: Malcolm 16-4-52-0, Headley 19-3-56-2, Croft</p>
<p>26.5-6-74-2, Caddick 20-2-85-3, B.Hollioake 5-1-26-1,</p>
<p>A.Hollioake 12-2-31-2.</p>
